// Every simulation coefficient (GDD §5.9), hot-reloadable while `cargo run`
// is active (task 073) — save this file and the running game picks up the
// new values without restarting. Values here must match `SimConfig::default()`
// in `src/config.rs`; that hand-written `Default` impl exists so tests don't
// need Bevy's asset machinery, and the two are kept in sync by hand.
